    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "The Applicant is seeking anticipatory bail in connection with C.R.No.1417 of 2022,\nregistered at Hadapsar Police Station, Pune city, on 12.11.2022, under sections 272,\n273 and 328 of the Indian Penal Code and under sections 26(2)(i), 26(2)(iv), 3(1)(zz)\n(iv) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (hereinafter referred to as 'FSS Act').\n2.",
